@startuml Sprint 30 — IntelliJ 3-way Merge Flow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title Sprint 30 (R30.9) — IntelliJ-faithful base-aware 3-way merge flow

actor "Developer" as Dev
participant "RbEditorLayout" as Layout
participant "RbDiffEditor" as Diff
participant "GitApi\n(server.ts)" as Git
participant "RepoRegistry" as Reg
database "Git repo\n(rawbin / oosh)" as Repo

== Open (R30.6.6) ==
Dev -> Layout : click [Open Diff]
Layout -> Diff : showDiff(currentFilePath)
Diff -> Diff : monacoLoader() — reuse CDN/AMD Monaco (dedup)
Diff -> Diff : mountThreePane() — LEFT local | CENTER result | RIGHT remote
note over Diff : LEFT = current working file (preselected)

== Pick RIGHT (R30.6.4 / R30.10 default) ==
Dev -> Diff : pick ref (or R30.10: RIGHT defaults to file history)
Diff -> Git : GET /api/git/file?repo&ref&path  (loadSide 'right')
Git -> Reg : resolve(repo) -> abs root
Reg -> Git : root (allowlist)
Git -> Git : guardRef(ref)  (R30.7 uniform allowlist)
Git -> Repo : git show <ref>:<path>
Repo -> Git : remote content
Git -> Diff : RIGHT content

== Base-aware merge (R30.9 computeMergedCenter) ==
Diff -> Git : GET /api/git/merge-base?repo&a=leftRef&b=rightRef
Git -> Reg : resolve(repo)
Git -> Git : guardRef(a), guardRef(b)
Git -> Repo : git merge-base a b
Repo -> Git : base sha (common ancestor)
Git -> Diff : base sha

alt base exists (git-version merge)
  Diff -> Git : fileAtRef(base, path) -> BASE content
  Diff -> Diff : diff3Merge(local, base, remote)
  note over Diff #LightGreen : CENTER = non-conflicting AUTO-MERGED\n+ true conflict regions flagged
else no common base (unrelated / working-only)
  note over Diff : fall back to 2-way\n(CENTER = local, manual take-over)
end

Diff -> Diff : renderMergeGutter() — ◄ accept-left / ► accept-right per conflict

== Resolve (R30.9) ==
Dev -> Diff : acceptChange(conflictId, side)
Diff -> Diff : apply side's chunk into CENTER (aligned range)
Dev -> Diff : applyAllNonConflicting()
note over Diff : diff3 already pre-applied ok-chunks;\nconfirms remaining trivial merges
Dev -> Diff : scroll
Diff -> Diff : syncScroll3() — lock scroll across 3 editors

== Save ==
Dev -> Diff : save
Diff -> Git : POST /api/files/<path>  (CENTER, mtime-guard)
Git -> Repo : write merged result
Git -> Diff : ok

note over Dev, Repo #FFF8DC
  Verified live v0.7.18: OOSH(main,dev) -> common ancestor 6571a8a4
  (base-aware), rawbin(main,main) -> HEAD, bad-ref -> 400.
end note
@enduml
